+
+## NSGA-II eligibility
+
+Carry current filter outcomes through parent/child selection. Filter-rejected
+proposals have empty objective vectors, rank after eligible proposals and are
+excluded from final results; do not reconstruct eligibility from scalar penalties
+or stale metadata. Test rejected initial proposals, rejected offspring and an
+all-rejected population. See `notes/error-handling.md`.
